\f4\b\fs40 \cf0 \uc0\u9888 \u65039  Hidden Costs to Avoid\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls3\ilvl0
\fs32 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Text Type Pitfall:
\f5\b0  Never store prices as 
\f2\fs28 TEXT
\f5\fs32 . While it preserves formatting, it prevents you from using numeric SQL functions like 
\f2\fs28 SUM()
\f5\fs32 , 
\f2\fs28 AVG()
\f5\fs32 , or inequality filters (
\f2\fs28 >
\f5\fs32 ,
\f2\fs28 <
\f5\fs32 ) efficiently.\
\ls3\ilvl0
\f4\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Math Order:
\f5\b0  Always multiply your quantities 
\f6\i before
\f5\i0  dividing by 100 to prevent premature truncation in complex SQL queries.\
